{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07507","headline":"入桂渚次砂牛石穴 · 刘长卿","name":"入桂渚次砂牛石穴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟傍归路，日暮潇湘深。\n湘水清见底，楚云淡无心。\n片帆落桂渚，独夜依枫林。\n枫林月出猨声苦，桂渚天寒桂花吐。\n此中无处不堪愁，江客相看泪如雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}